  "reported_checks": "21/21 focused task tests passed. A 200-seed, two-setting minimum-two-demo semantic sweep checked 400 episodes against 23 semantic rivals with zero ambiguous episodes and zero survivors; a 50-seed maximum-six-demo sweep checked 100 episodes with zero ambiguity and zero survivors. Protected Racket checked 20 episodes, 406 rival evaluations and 120 selected-label replays, retained one exact counterexample for each of 23 wrong programs, included a substantive 30x30 case, and found no surviving rival. Strict overrides, bool rejection, exact canonical bytes, matched setting-neutral inputs, negative certificate cases, skip-A causal behavior, adapter/promotion validation, and public/private first-turn invariance were covered by the focused suite.",
